                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "At de, we are proud to support Breast Cancer Awareness month in October. However, this is an on-going fight that lasts long after the month has ended. It’s important that we not only rally around this cause in October but continue to show our support all year long. Here are some ways that you can show your support every day:",
